1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Louise Marie Mayer, nee Gottlieb.  Born in Vienna, Austria, 27 December 1882, perished in Auschwitz  April 26, 1944 Daughter of Albert Gottlieb (born August 5, 1845) and Clara Gottlieb, nee Fischhof, born 14 Septem
2 CONC ber 1858. Married to Otto Karl Mayer (born July 30, 1874, died April 17, 1936) A daughter, Helene, was born July 14, 1905, and a son, Karl, later called Charles, was born 21 June 1907. Louise Marie Mayer was a journalist and playw
2 CONC right. She was an active member of the anti-Nazi resistance group Mueller-Thanner. The group consisted of gentiles and Jews. From November 1939 LMM was incarcerated and deported to Auschwitz in 1944.  https://www.univie.ac.at/biog
2 CONC rafiA/projekt/Widerstandskaempferinnen/Mayer_Louise.htm
